{"title":"Ogre Bone Needle","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Mountain Ogre, Ogre Elder</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>. Each <b>quality reroll</b> of <b>knick armor</b> uses one.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Ogre</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-carver\">Ogre Carver</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker\">Ogre Firespeaker</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved\">The Unmoved</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 2 of 343 looted corpses (1/172)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/172<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 1 of 550 looted corpses (1/550)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/550<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"ogre-bone-needle\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/b650deb68f23ed25cd11.svg\" alt=\"Ogre Bone Needle\"></div><h3>Ogre Bone Needle</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 10:59:58 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}